				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "a/exACL+DQCaHdQuBdyQ/A=="
				},
				"string" : "\n\"Program testing can be used to show the presence of bugs, but never to show their absence!\"\n\n― Edsger W. Dijkstra\n"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-22T16:32:26.061185+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-22T16:39:19.579897+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "luEe7CH+DQCXRc8VBdyQ/A=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "How can we assure that the gaming strategies we've provided until now are good enough to never be defeated?"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-22T16:39:42.475338+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-22T16:40:21.173534+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "gggiBiL+DQCbkYhxBdyQ/A=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "BP programs can be analyzed by traversing their possible runtime states. In other words, given enough time and resources, it is possible to visit each state a b-program might reach. Such traversal can be used to verify both that all states are OK (for some formal definition of “OK”) and that transitions between states conform to certain constraints. "
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-22T16:41:11.961036+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-22T16:42:34.100463+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "+Xl3CyL+DQCcuuoqBdyQ/A=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "BPjs, and therefore the BPjs Bridge, supports **formal verification** of a b-program."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-22T18:43:51.540858+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-22T18:44:04.797137+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "pMAhwiP+DQCKq5eiCD9HEw=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "##Add verification to the TicTacToe game"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-22T18:44:09.398639+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-22T18:44:24.289987+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "mz0ywyP+DQCLdHLbCD9HEw=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "We add the following *verify* method to our TicTacToe game:"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "pharoSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-22T18:44:32.416189+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T14:29:59.725208+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "2nWRxCP+DQCMnMA7CD9HEw=="
				},
				"code" : "Gt4BpTicTacToeGame\r\tcompile: 'verify\r\t| verificationResult |\r\tverificationResult := (Gt4BpVerifierBridge\r\t\t\tfromDirectory: bpRunner btDirectory\r\t\t\tensureDelete: false)\r\t\t\tverifyWithOptions: {Gt4BpVerifierBridge inspectionsOption -> #(''FAILED_ASSERTIONS'')} asDictionary.\r\tverificationResult\r\t\ttransformation: [ :anEvent | \r\t\t\t| allEvents pastEvents |\r\t\t\tallEvents := verificationResult counterExample.\r\t\t\tpastEvents := allEvents copyFrom: 1 to: (allEvents find: anEvent).\r\t\t\tGt4BpTicTacToeGame withEvents: pastEvents ].\r\t^ verificationResult'\r\tclassified: #verification"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T14:23:48.644127+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T14:25:16.010076+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "8gYCPTT+DQCot31gBcjYgw=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "In the case a violation was found by the verification, we'd like to visualize each of the counterexample's events on the TicTacToe board, so we define a way to build a *TicTacToe* from a collection of BP events:"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "pharoSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T14:25:22.307052+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T14:29:03.722486+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "EwCNQzT+DQCu8wkaBcjYgw=="
				},
				"code" : "Gt4BpTicTacToeGame class\r\tcompile: 'withEvents: aCollectionOfEvents\r\t| game |\r\tgame := self new.\r\taCollectionOfEvents do: [ :anEvent | game handleBPEvent: anEvent ].\r\t^ game'\r\tclassified: 'instance - creation'"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-22T18:45:33.434294+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-22T18:45:50.786852+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "44U0yCP+DQCNb40PCD9HEw=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "##Verify the current game implementation"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-22T16:42:20.014958+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-22T16:47:59.293303+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "luWFDyL+DQCeTJrVBdyQ/A=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "We're going to use this powerful feature to verify if our b-program is *correct*. We can understand that our player O automation is \"correct\" if certain event (in our case the *gameOver* event with the player X as winner) could never be produced."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-22T16:46:25.602904+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-22T16:47:05.434086+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "g0UpHiL+DQCkIHWYBdyQ/A=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "We can express this **anti-scenario** using the function *bp.ASSERT* as we do in the following b-thread:"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "pharoSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-22T16:47:08.871806+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-22T16:47:51.23735+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "noC9ICL+DQCmdUKdBdyQ/A=="
				},
				"code" : "btXShouldNeverWin :=\r\t'bp.registerBThread(\"XShouldNeverWin\", function() {\r\t    var XWinES = bp.EventSet(\"XWin\", function(evt) {\r\t    \treturn evt.data == null ? false : (evt.name == \"gameOver\" && evt.data.winner == \"X\");\r\t    });\n        bp.sync({ waitFor: XWinES });\r        bp.ASSERT(false, \"X should never win\");\n});'."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-22T16:48:22.759479+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-22T16:49:42.20655+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "Y/AkJSL+DQCm0P1lBdyQ/A=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "In order to the verifier can traverse the state space of our program we need to define a b-thread that simulates the moves of player X, as the following:"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "pharoSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-22T16:49:45.449912+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-22T16:49:57.456965+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "2rESKiL+DQCrjNpbBdyQ/A=="
				},
				"code" : "btXPlayer :=\r\t'bp.registerBThread(\"XPlayer\", function() {\r\t    while(true) {\n\t        bp.sync({ request: [ \r\t            bp.Event(\"move\", { \"player\": \"X\", \"row\": 1, \"col\": 1}), \r\t            bp.Event(\"move\", { \"player\": \"X\", \"row\": 1, \"col\": 2}), \r\t            bp.Event(\"move\", { \"player\": \"X\", \"row\": 1, \"col\": 3}), \r\t            bp.Event(\"move\", { \"player\": \"X\", \"row\": 2, \"col\": 1}), \r\t            bp.Event(\"move\", { \"player\": \"X\", \"row\": 2, \"col\": 2}), \r\t            bp.Event(\"move\", { \"player\": \"X\", \"row\": 2, \"col\": 3}), \r\t            bp.Event(\"move\", { \"player\": \"X\", \"row\": 3, \"col\": 1}), \r\t            bp.Event(\"move\", { \"player\": \"X\", \"row\": 3, \"col\": 2}), \r\t            bp.Event(\"move\", { \"player\": \"X\", \"row\": 3, \"col\": 3}) ]});\r\t        }\r});'"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-22T16:50:27.500953+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-22T16:51:35.981858+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "vYRJLCL+DQCrlaPVBdyQ/A=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "In order to verify the latest version of our Human-vs-Machine TicTacToe we only need to add the two previous b-theads to the existing ones and use the verification feature supported by Gt4BP:"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "pharoSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-22T16:51:41.776279+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-22T18:23:46.556079+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "v7EBMSL+DQCvyqmTBdyQ/A=="
				},
				"code" : "(Gt4BpTicTacToeExamples new humanVsMachineAddThirdOGame)\r\tloadBThread: btXShouldNeverWin named: 'bt-XShouldNeverWin.js';\r\tloadBThread: btXPlayer named: 'bt-XPlayer.js';\r\tverify"
			}
		]
	},
